# Payabli iOS SDK

Official iOS SDK for accepting payments via Payabli. This release is the
**Tap to Pay on iPhone** distribution and ships three pre-built
XCFrameworks:

- `PayabliSDKCore` — shared infrastructure (auth, transport, logging).
- `PayabliSDKTapToPay` — Tap to Pay on iPhone (attestation, session,
  charge, activation). Bilingual Swift / Objective-C surface so the
  module is consumable from MAUI/Xamarin, Flutter, and React Native
  hosts as well as native Swift apps.
- `PayabliCardReaderCore` — MIT-licensed Tap to Phone card reader engine,
  pulled in transitively by `PayabliSDKTapToPay`.

> **Looking for `PayabliSDKPayIn`?** The card/ACH/Apple Pay surface
> lives unchanged on the SDK's `develop` branch and will be re-introduced
> in a future release. This package is intentionally TTP-only.

Source for the Payabli-owned modules lives in a private repo; this repo
is a distribution mirror that ships a Swift Package Manager manifest
pointing to signed binary artifacts on Payabli's CDN.

Latest version: **${VERSION}**

## Installation

### Swift Package Manager (recommended)

Add the package in Xcode (File → Add Packages…) or edit your `Package.swift`:

```swift
// Production (GA) — recommended for shipping apps.
.package(
    url: "https://github.com/payabli/payabli-sdk-ios",
    from: "1.0.0"
)

// Sandbox (beta) — partners opted in to early-access releases.
.package(
    url: "https://github.com/payabli/payabli-sdk-ios",
    exact: "<latest-beta>"
)

// QA — internal Payabli engineers reproducing bugs against backend QA.
.package(
    url: "https://github.com/payabli/payabli-sdk-ios",
    exact: "<latest-qa>"
)
```

Then link the products your app needs:

- `PayabliSDK` — umbrella (Core + TapToPay + CardReaderCore); the typical choice for TTP integrations.
- `PayabliSDKCore` — shared infrastructure only (no payment flows).
- `PayabliSDKTapToPay` — Tap to Pay on iPhone (transitively pulls Core + CardReaderCore).

### CocoaPods

CocoaPods support is planned for a future release. For now, integrate via
Swift Package Manager.

## Requirements

- iOS 16.7 or newer (required by Apple's `ProximityReader` for Tap to Pay)
- Xcode 15 or newer
- Swift 5.9 or newer

## Release channels

| Channel    | Tag pattern            | Audience                                         |
|------------|------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| Production | `1.0.247`              | Shipping integrations (default)                  |
| Sandbox    | `1.0.247-beta`         | Partners opted in to early-access validation     |
| QA         | `1.0.247-qa`           | Internal Payabli engineering and bug reproduction |

All three channels are distributed via Swift Package Manager; beta and QA
are marked as pre-releases on GitHub.

